- You were bullied?

832
00:38:15.580 --> 00:38:16.830
- That’s what I’m saying.
- I was too.

833
00:38:16.950 --> 00:38:19.450
And when you're bullied,
when you are maligned...

834
00:38:19.580 --> 00:38:20.580
Yeah.

835
00:38:21.330 --> 00:38:25.450
