that vulnerability, that innocence.

836
00:38:25.700 --> 00:38:26.700
- Yeah.
- Shush.

837
00:38:26.950 --> 00:38:30.200
And distrust enters. Cynicism.

838
00:38:30.450 --> 00:38:32.830
You tell that little boy,
"You’re safe now." Right?

839
00:38:33.080 --> 00:38:36.450
"All that stuff that happened to you before,
I will protect you from it now."

840
00:38:36.580 --> 00:38:38.950
