I’m loving, I’m attentive, I'm open.

851
00:39:03.950 --> 00:39:06.080
- That’s so great.
- He’s like my best friend.

852
00:39:06.330 --> 00:39:08.330
We can talk about anything.

853
00:39:08.450 --> 00:39:11.580
I’m demonstrative. I hug my son.

854
00:39:11.830 --> 00:39:15.200
Always have! Even now, when he doesn’t
want me to hug him anymore.

855
00:39:15.450 --> 00:39:16.330
(Audience laughs)

856
00:39:16.580 --> 00:39:19.330
- My dad never hugged me.
- My dad was an old cunt.

857
00:39:19.580 --> 00:39:22.580
He was a cock-sucking
motherfucking piece of shit cunt.

858
00:39:23.080 --> 00:39:24.830
- Yeah, mine too.
- Yeah, you told me.

859
00:39:25.080 --> 00:39:28.830
My dad threw my mum down the stairs
when I was about five.

860
00:39:29.080 --> 00:39:31.950
I watched it all.
Shaking so much I thought I was gonna die.

861
00:39:32.200 --> 00:39:36.200
Yeah, yeah, yeah. You told me all this,
