862
00:39:36.450 --> 00:39:37.830
- Right.
- It’s not all about you.

863
00:39:38.080 --> 00:39:39.950
- OK.
- You have to learn that in recovery.

864
00:39:40.200 --> 00:39:43.200
Alcoholics, we’re very selfish,
