- Yeah.
- Only thinking about ourselves.

866
00:39:45.580 --> 00:39:47.080
- OK.
- We have to learn to listen.

867
00:39:47.330 --> 00:39:49.450
The world does not
revolve around Luka.

868
00:39:49.700 --> 00:39:52.700
Stop thinking about yourself.
That is a sure-fire way to get drunk.

869
00:39:52.950 --> 00:39:54.330
- Yeah, totally.
- Hm.

870
00:39:54.580 --> 00:39:55.580
Erm...

871
