- The House of fucking Montagu.

878
00:40:15.080 --> 00:40:17.080
Everyone you meet
could be Christ in disguise.

879
00:40:17.330 --> 00:40:20.200
So treat everyone
as you would treat Christ.

880
00:40:22.330 --> 00:40:23.580
