when I was in her belly.

923
00:42:27.200 --> 00:42:29.700
I shouldn’t be here, James.
I should be dead.

924
00:42:29.950 --> 00:42:33.950
Someone was looking out for me.
Someone was protecting me.

925
00:42:34.200 --> 00:42:38.330
And thousands of years ago,
in a desert in ancient Jerusalem,

926
00:42:38.580 --> 00:42:42.080
some mad wee guy
in, like, a divinely-inspired state

927
00:42:42.330 --> 00:42:44.330
wrote those words down.

928
00:42:44.580 --> 00:42:46.950
And, what,
you think that's just a coincidence?

929
00:42:47.200 --> 00:42:49.330
That those very same words

930
00:42:49.580 --> 00:42:52.200
