and resonate with me today?

932
00:42:55.330 --> 00:42:58.080
You don’t think a higher power
needed me to hear that?

933
00:42:59.330 --> 00:43:03.450
When Jesus talks directly to me
through the Gospels

934
00:43:03.700 --> 00:43:07.580
telling me that I can’t add
a single hour to my life by worrying...

935
00:43:07.830 --> 00:43:10.580
(Sighs) Oh, I find that reassuring.

936
00:43:10.830 --> 00:43:13.330
And not cos it's easy,
but because it's true.

937
00:43:13.580 --> 00:43:17.080
When you place your life and your cares
in God’s hands, things get better.

938
00:43:17.330 --> 00:43:18.580
It works.

939
00:43:18.830 --> 00:43:20.450
And that is the same with AA.

940
00:43:20.700 --> 00:43:23.330
People have said,
"This worked for us. Try this."

941
00:43:23.580 --> 00:43:25.450
That’s all Christianity is.

942
00:43:25.700 --> 00:43:27.330
That’s all any religion is.

943
00:43:28.080 --> 00:43:29.830
You can’t say that
about a paper cup.

944
00:43:30.080 --> 00:43:31.080
(James) Fucking...!

945
00:43:31.330 --> 00:43:32.830
(Audience laughs)

946
00:43:33.830 --> 00:43:36.200
OK. Paedophilia, man.

947
